    "design": "Exploratory fixed-budget empirical bilinear canonical form. Reassemble H454512 cached L17 inputs; randomized document-disjoint train256/validation128/test128, all historically used. Center polynomial kernel ((x dot xprime)/1152)^2 on normalized training inputs; retain64 positive eigenmodes, whiten on train. Mean native write frozen. Best rank16 write regression by SVD; KL and observed-token CE start from that map and optimize same64x16/16x1152 normalized map for256 Adam steps. Select only own validation objective including step0. Canonicalize each learned effective coefficient matrix by SVD without changing predictions. Evaluate all three on write error, native-output KL and CE; intervention evaluation predicts MLP at normalized(pre-alpha*centered head6 donor), direct residual pre fixed. No retained native factors or output oracle coefficients. Data-supported representation, not unique weight canon or whole-network replacement. Primary descriptive paired bootstrap intervals; no success gates for this exploratory pilot.",
